  == census-results-in-brief-laos-population-census-2005-and-1995: Census results in brief (Laos population census 2005 and 1995)
     notes: A report summarising the results of the Laos Population Census in 2005 and comparing findings with the 1995 Census. The report provides data on population size and composition; population distribution and migration; household characteristics; education and literacy; economic activity; fertility; mortality; housing characteristics; and population projections.
